<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-Golden Vale H1 pre-tax profit up 59 pc.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Golden Vale H1 pre-tax profit up 59 pc.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.21		   vs 1.76</p>
<p> Interim div (pence)    0.72		   vs 0.66</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    6.52		   vs 4.05</p>
<p> Turnover		   277.96		 vs 289.02</p>
<p>NOTE - Irish food group Golden Vale Plc said net borrowings fell by 20 million Irish pounds to 62.7 million at end-June 1997.</p>
<p>It said all sectors of its business increased operating profits, most notably the cheese business.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom + 353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
